+
+# Implement JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386) applyMergePatch
+
+Added `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` in `src/merge-patch.ts`, exported from `src/index.ts`. Moved
+`isObject`, `isJsonValue` and `setMember` from `src/patch.ts` to `src/json.ts` so both patchers share
+them. Tests in `test/merge-patch.test.ts` cover the RFC 7386 Appendix A cases, the section 3 example,
+immutability, `__proto__` and non-JSON input; `npm test` passes (54 tests).
